        <ab type="folio" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u01">四</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u02">夾住、夾之大小、須量人之肥瘦恰合爲宜</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u03">愚見中土人醫此症、止用湯藥、偶可止痛、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u04">而不能令小腸送還本位、曷不令巧匠照</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u05">式仿造鋼夾、依法治之、乃爲有益也、並附</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u06">鋼夾圖於後、</ab>
        <ab type="figure-label" n="right" facs="#surface-c09" xml:id="c09-u07">治小腸疝偏右鋼夾圖</ab>
      </div>
